  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3209.09 Missing Stickers",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3209.09 Missing Stickers.\n\n(a) In the event an inspection station owner discovers sticker(s) which are missing, he or she shall immediately notify and make a full report to the local police department.\n\n(b) The notification in (a) above shall include:\n\n(1) The number of missing or stolen stickers; and\n\n(2) The number listed on each missing or stolen sticker.\n\n(c) In addition to (a) above, the inspection station owner shall immediately contact the department and follow up in writing.\n\n(d) In addition to (a) above, on-demand sticker backings shall be reported to the supplier electronically in accordance with contractual agreements between the supplier and inspection stations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16; ss by #12196, eff 10-1-17",
